===Noun===
{{en-noun|hypodermes}}

# An [[epidermal]] layer of cells that secretes an overlying chitinous [[cuticle]], as in [[arthropod]]s. 
# {{context|botany}} A layer of cells lying immediately below the [[epidermis]]. 
# {{context|anatomy}} A [[subcutaneous]] layer of loose connective tissue containing fat cells, lying beneath the [[dermis]].

